    <h1 id="hero-h">Nurse call for hospital wards</h1>
    <p class="t-lead">A patient presses the bed switch or pulls the bathroom cord, and the nurse station and the staff app know at once. Wired or wireless, for a 10-bed clinic up to a 200-bed hospital with Code Blue.</p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/#demo">Request a demo<svg class="m-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path class="m-arrow__stem" d="M1 6h8"/><path class="m-arrow__head" d="M4.5 2.5 8 6l-3.5 3.5"/></svg></a><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/contact/">Talk to our experts</a></div>
