<section class="section " id="parts" aria-labelledby="parts-h">
<div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><h2 id="parts-h">What is on the ward. <span class="muted">Five parts, one call path.</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid--cards"><article class="card span-4 m-nolift"><h3>Bed switch with pendant</h3><p>Within reach of the patient, so a call takes one press from the bed.</p></article><article class="card span-4 m-nolift"><h3>Bathroom pull-cord</h3><p>A call point where falls happen, separate from the bed switch.</p></article><article class="card span-4 m-nolift"><h3>Nurse station display</h3><p>Every open call on one screen at the station, by bed and by ward.</p></article><article class="card span-4 m-nolift"><h3>Staff app</h3><p>Calls reach the nurse on the move, not only the person at the desk.</p></article><article class="card span-4 m-nolift"><h3>Reporting software</h3><p>Runs on a local server in the hospital and keeps the record of every call.</p></article><article class="card span-4 m-nolift"><h3>Corridor door indicators</h3><p>On larger wards, a light over the door shows which room is calling.</p></article></div></div>
</section>
