<div class="grid grid--top"><div class="span-6 stack-5"><div class="specs"><div class="specs__head"><span>Model-wise specifications</span><span class="chip-soon">Awaiting catalogue</span></div><ul><li><span class="specs__name">Small</span><span class="specs__desc">About 10 beds · 2 switches</span><span class="specs__soon">Specifications coming soon</span></li><li><span class="specs__name">Medium</span><span class="specs__desc">About 25 beds across 2 floors</span><span class="specs__soon">Specifications coming soon</span></li><li><span class="specs__name">Large</span><span class="specs__desc">50 to 100 beds · Corridor door indicators</span><span class="specs__soon">Specifications coming soon</span></li><li><span class="specs__name">Advanced</span><span class="specs__desc">About 200 beds · Code Blue, 4 switches</span><span class="specs__soon">Specifications coming soon</span></li></ul></div><div class="tbc"><p class="t-label muted">Tier names, to be confirmed</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip chip--static">Plus</span><span class="chip chip--static">Professional</span><span class="chip chip--static">Enterprise</span></div><p class="t-small">Plus, Professional and Enterprise are the planned tier names. Which tier maps to which ward size is still to be confirmed.</p></div></div><div class="span-6 start-7"><div class="panel-win"><div class="win win--ncs" role="img" aria-label="Nurse station display showing open calls by bed, with one call being attended"><div class="win__bar"><span class="win__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="win__title">Nurse station · Ward B</span><span class="win__tag">Illustrative screen</span></div><div class="win__body">
